# Never upload these to Cloudflare.
#
# The assets directory is the repo root, so without this file wrangler ships the
# git database and the working files along with the site. Cloudflare's _redirects
# has no 404 action, so exclusion — not a redirect — is what keeps them private.
#
# Wrangler uploads what is on DISK, not what is in git, and it does not read
# .gitignore. A file that is gitignored but sitting in this folder is still
# published unless it is named here - hence the secrets and OS/editor entries.
.git
.gitignore
.assetsignore
.wrangler
__pycache__
*.pyc
_source-images
rebuild-images.py
hubspot-provision.mjs
README.md
HUBSPOT-SETUP.md
wrangler.jsonc
_templates
# The Worker source and its local secrets (wrangler dev reads .dev.vars).
worker
.dev.vars
.dev.vars.*
# Secrets that must never be served, should one ever be dropped here.
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
# Tooling, editor and OS files.
node_modules
.vscode
.idea
.claude
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
